The files in model/ are the three parts of lid.176.bin, the language
identification model published by Facebook, Inc. at
https://fasttext.cc/docs/en/language-identification.html

    https://dl.fbaipublicfiles.com/fasttext/supervised-models/lid.176.bin
    SHA-256 (all parts concatenated, in order):
    7e69ec5451bc261cc7844e49e4792a85d7f09c06789ec800fc4a44aec362764e

The model is distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-Share-Alike
License 3.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

The model is unchanged; it was only split into parts because GitHub does not
accept files larger than 100 MB.

The model is described in:

  A. Joulin, E. Grave, P. Bojanowski, T. Mikolov,
  Bag of Tricks for Efficient Text Classification, EACL 2017.
  https://arxiv.org/abs/1607.01759

  A. Joulin, E. Grave, P. Bojanowski, M. Douze, H. Jégou, T. Mikolov,
  FastText.zip: Compressing text classification models, 2016.
  https://arxiv.org/abs/1612.03651

